# Headlinr — Project Context

## App Identity

- **App name**: Headlinr
- **App package**: `avinash.app.headlinr`
- **News module package**: `avinash.app.news`
- **Min SDK**: 24 | **Target/Compile SDK**: 36
- **Language**: Kotlin | **UI**: Jetpack Compose | **DI**: Hilt

## Architecture

```
GitHub Actions (every 30 min) → Firebase Firestore → news module (Room SSOT) → app module (UI)
```

- **`news/`** — Data-only library module. Exposes `NewsRepository`, `NewsArticle`, `Category`. No UI, no ViewModel, no Compose.
- **`app/`** — Host app. Owns all screens, ViewModels, navigation, and AdMob. Depends on `:news`.
- Room is the **single source of truth**. All UI reads from Room, never Firestore directly.
- Sync happens only on app open — **no WorkManager**.

## Module Boundaries (strict)

| Layer | Module | Visibility |
|-------|--------|------------|
| `avinash.app.news.api.*` | `news` | PUBLIC — host app imports only this |
| `avinash.app.news.internal.*` | `news` | PRIVATE — never imported by host |
| `avinash.app.headlinr.*` | `app` | Host app code |

## Key Files

| Purpose | Path |
|---------|------|
| Public API | `news/…/api/NewsRepository.kt` |
| Domain models | `news/…/api/model/NewsArticle.kt`, `Category.kt` |
| Room DB | `news/…/internal/local/NewsDatabase.kt` |
| Firebase fetch | `news/…/internal/remote/FirebaseNewsSource.kt` |
| Sync logic | `news/…/internal/sync/SyncManager.kt` |
| DI wiring | `news/…/di/NewsModule.kt` |
| ViewModel | `app/…/viewmodel/NewsViewModel.kt` |
| Home screen | `app/…/ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt` |
| Full plan | `plan.md` (root) |

## Conventions

- All timestamps stored as `Long` (epoch millis) in Room; `Timestamp` in Firestore.
- Article IDs are SHA-256 hashes of `(normalized_title + normalized_source)` — generated by GitHub Actions.
- Categories are dynamic (from Firebase), never hardcoded.
- Zero cost — everything must stay within free tier limits (Firebase Spark, GitHub Actions 2000 min/month, API free tiers).

## GitHub Actions

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `.github/workflows/fetch-news.yml` | Cron workflow, runs every 30 min |
| `scripts/fetch_news.py` | Fetches from 3 providers, normalizes, deduplicates, uploads to Firebase |
| `scripts/requirements.txt` | Python deps for the workflow |

Secrets required in GitHub repo: `CURRENTSAPI_KEY`, `NEWSDATA_KEY`, `RAPIDAPI_KEY`, `FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT` (entire JSON).

Two-tier schedule:
- **Tier 1** (every 30 min): currentsapi latest headlines (~1 API call)
- **Tier 2** (every 4 hours): newsdata.io + contextualweb category fills + 7-day cleanup

## Dependencies (version catalog)

Managed via `gradle/libs.versions.toml`. Key libraries:
- Hilt 2.51.1, Room 2.7.1, Paging 3.3.6, Firebase BOM 33.7.0
- Coil 2.7.0, Navigation Compose 2.8.9, Timber 5.0.1, DataStore 1.4.0
